    "id": "algo_n_249",
    "name": "Algorithm Snippet",
    "code": "def print_N_mostFrequentNumber(arr, N, K):\n    # HashMap to store count of the elements\n    count = {}    \n     \n    # Array to store the elements according\n    # to their frequency\n    freq = [[] for i in range(len(arr) + 1)]\n    for n in arr:\n        count[n] = 1 + count.get(n, 0)\n    for n, c in count.items():\n        freq.append(n)\n \n    res = []\n    # if K elements have been printed\n    for i in range(len(freq)-1, 0, -1):\n        for n in freq[i]:\n            res.append(n)\n            if len(res) == K:\n                return res[-1::-1]\n \n \n# Driver's code\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    arr = [3, 1, 4, 4, 5, 2, 6, 1]\n    N = len(arr)\n    K = 2\n \n    # Function call\n    print(print_N_mostFrequentNumber(arr, N, K))",
